{"3921400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Virtuoso GP Race - On", "steam_appid": 3921400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAM NEXT FEST:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free demo — download ~110 MB • on track in &lt;10 s</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First launch:</strong> choose steering — <strong>Cabinet</strong> (’90s) or <strong>Analog</strong> (direct). Tip: On <strong>Sakura</strong>, almost flat-out; <strong>only one real brake</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Restart</strong> visible (key + gamepad) • <strong>Easy/Normal</strong>, <strong>mph or km/h</strong>, <strong>global leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtuoso GP Race-On</strong> doesn’t copy or “dress up” the retro: it’s a <strong>new</strong> arcade racer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with <strong>bespoke physics</strong> and handling that recreates the feel of 90s polygonal greats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn’t emulation or a fancy filter: gameplay comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY YOU’LL GET HOOKED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>True 90s handling</strong>: precision, inertia and tuned drifts — not a “retro look” with modern-feel controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>EXTEND TIME</strong>: hit checkpoints, gain seconds; miss one and it’s <strong>Game Over</strong>. Pure arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Instant loop</strong>: restart instantly, with <strong>ghosts &amp; split times</strong>… “one more run”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Global leaderboards</strong>: fight for thousandths and share your best laps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Arcade</strong>: 3 chained routes in classic style, time pressure and route choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Season</strong>: a full championship across the <strong>9 tracks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Career</strong>: upgrade your car step by step and beat new rivals in progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Minigames</strong>: skill challenges to master drift, line and rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>9 tracks</strong> with their <strong>reverse versions</strong>, across 3 regions (Americas, Eurasia, Africa/Oceania).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>3 vehicle classes</strong> and <strong>unlockable cars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Global record table</strong> with ghosts and split times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISUAL STYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Low-poly with <strong>dithering</strong> and <strong>reduced color palettes</strong> for an authentic 90s grain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simulated <strong>4:3 → 16:9</strong> stretching (as on period monitors).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- “Aged” art and clean UI for instant readability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRY IT: FREE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>2 tracks</strong>: <strong>Sakura Coast</strong> and <strong>Dunas de Giza</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>1 single-seater</strong> tuned to slide sideways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Works with <strong>keyboard and gamepad</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Instant restart</strong> to practice and set times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHO IS IT FOR?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who lived —or seek today— <i>true arcade racing</i>: tight control,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >time pressure and the satisfaction of nailing the perfect lap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN THE PIT CREW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist and play the demo. Ready… GO!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEAM NEXT FEST:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free demo — download ~110 MB • on track in &lt;10 s</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First launch:</strong> choose steering — <strong>Cabinet</strong> (’90s) or <strong>Analog</strong> (direct). Tip: On <strong>Sakura</strong>, almost flat-out; <strong>only one real brake</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Restart</strong> visible (key + gamepad) • <strong>Easy/Normal</strong>, <strong>mph or km/h</strong>, <strong>global leaderboards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtuoso GP Race-On</strong> doesn’t copy or “dress up” the retro: it’s a <strong>new</strong> arcade racer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with <strong>bespoke physics</strong> and handling that recreates the feel of 90s polygonal greats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn’t emulation or a fancy filter: gameplay comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY YOU’LL GET HOOKED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>True 90s handling</strong>: precision, inertia and tuned drifts — not a “retro look” with modern-feel controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>EXTEND TIME</strong>: hit checkpoints, gain seconds; miss one and it’s <strong>Game Over</strong>. Pure arcade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Instant loop</strong>: restart instantly, with <strong>ghosts &amp; split times</strong>… “one more run”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Global leaderboards</strong>: fight for thousandths and